# Every discoverable area of Zephras Isle (20 map overlays), for both factions.
# Each `explore` point is the centre of the area's map overlay hit rect in the
# Forever client's tables (WorldMapOverlay, UiMapXMapArt, UiMap, AreaTable via
# wago.tools, build 1.60.1.70338), in the map's live frame (written `live` where
# Forever moved the map or added it, else the Era frame it equals); area levels
# are AreaTable.ExplorationLevel; flight masters come from
# data/forever/travel.json. Zone order and travel lines are
# tools/lib/exploration/spec.js; inside a zone the areas are a shortest tour
# from where you arrive towards the next zone.
#
# INGAME: does Zephras Isle count towards the world-map Legacy Challenge? Beta write-ups list it among the
# new areas of the map, while the challenge list itself names the zones of the Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor
# (Explore Azeroth); the client parents the isle's map to Azeroth, on no continent. Until it is settled the
# guide does not claim it counts.

